<title>PHILIPPINES: Robinson's signs property lease with govt.</title>
<headline>Robinson's signs property lease with govt.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robinson's Land Corp, the real estate arm of J.G. Summit Holdings Inc, said on Friday it has entered into a lease contract with the government's National Housing Authority for the 37-hectare North Triangle property in suburban Quezon city.</p>
<p>The agreement was signed together with New San Jose Builders.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 841-8937 fax 8176267</p>
